Not currently vendored
-----------------------

The following third-party data sources are named in spec.md §7/§14 as
optional or future sources. Neither is vendored into this repository as of
this batch, so no attribution obligation exists yet — noted here so it
isn't forgotten when either is added:

- **withfig/autocomplete** (spec §7 Tier A, optional secondary source).
  MIT-licensed per spec.md's own dependency table, but this has **not been
  independently re-verified by this project** the way the carapace-bin
  license was for this NOTICE. Re-verify at the time it's actually vendored.
- **mandoc source** (spec §7 Tier D, deferred entirely in this batch,
  feature-gated behind `manpage`). ISC-licensed per spec.md's dependency
  table (mandoc.bsd.lv); not vendored, no build has been attempted.

Crate (code) dependency licenses
----------------------------------

Every Rust crate dependency's license is declared in its own `Cargo.toml`
and resolvable via standard tooling (e.g. `cargo license`); they are not
duplicated here. See spec.md §14 for the dependency table this project was
designed against.
